In order keep your betrothal on a more precise temporal footing, please enjoy this marriage duration clock.\
\
Once it\'92s up and running, the clock will repeatedly tell you the exact length of your marriage in seconds, minutes, hours, days, weeks, fortnights, years, decades, and centuries.\
\
The clock is completely self-contained, and does not need to be connected to any network. It\'92s preloaded with the date and time of your wedding ceremony, and it uses a built in GPS unit in order to acquire the precise current time. A small computer inside the clock does all the calculations.\
\
The knob on the left controls the screen brightness, the knob on the right controls how quickly the text scrolls by.\
\
The clock may take several minutes, or even longer, to begin functioning. During that time the GPS unit is acquiring the needed satellite signals to begin accurately reporting the time. If an hour or more goes by and it\'92s still not showing the current length of your marriage, try moving it to another part of your house\'85 perhaps closer to a window. I expect it to work just fine in the majority of rooms, but not very well in basements, bathrooms, dungeons, etc.\
\
The clock has a lifetime warranty, just like your marriage, so feel free to return it (the clock, not the marriage) anytime for free repairs or replacement.  \
